Breaks: The settings dialog checks only that a number or a size is one, not that it lies in its range, so a value outside it is sent.
Module: catalog-server
Test: ConsoleSettingsBrowserTest#aValueOutsideTheAllowedOnesIsRefusedInTheDialogAndNeverSent

